Data bundled in src/artefact/data
---------------------------------
The files below are redistributed with artefact. They are not covered by the GPL
notice above; each remains under the terms of its original source. Please cite the
sources when you use them.

filters/*.csv, filters.yaml
    Photometric filter transmission curves from the SVO Filter Profile Service
    (http://svo2.cab.inta-csic.es/theory/fps/; Rodrigo, Esplin & Jimenez 2012;
    Rodrigo & Solano 2020), downloaded 2026-11-02, with the ALMA, Spitzer IRS and
    JCMT SCUBA-2 curves built for artefact. The source of each curve is recorded in
    the comment header of its file.

stellar_models/G2V_spectrum.npz, stellar_models/A0V_spectrum.npz
    BT-NextGen (AGSS2009) model atmospheres (Allard, Homeier & Freytag 2012), obtained
    through the SVO Theoretical Spectra service (http://svo2.cab.inta-csic.es/theory/).
    The numbers are unchanged from the SVO text tables; they were converted to NumPy
    .npz archives to reduce their size (see contrib/svo_to_npz.py), and the original
    comment header of each table is stored in the archive.

stellar_models/phoenix_grid.npz, phoenix_grid.sha256
    A grid of PHOENIX-ACES-AGSS-COND-2011 synthetic spectra (Husser et al. 2013,
    A&A 553, A6; http://phoenix.astro.physik.uni-goettingen.de), reduced and
    resampled by artefact (see src/artefact/phoenix.py).

optical_constants/astrosil.lnk
